<h2>House rules</h2><ul>
<li>No real client or prospect is named without written consent.</li>
<li>Scenes built from patterns rather than a real case are labeled as composites.</li>
<li>No invented facts, quotes or numbers, and no savings promises. Claims come with a source and the date checked.</li>
<li>We count visits and link clicks with GoatCounter. It uses no cookies and doesn't store IP addresses or other personal data. The newsletter is opt-in.</li></ul>
